"**MPs who nominated both Jeremy\u202fCorbyn (2015 leadership contest) and Keir\u202fStarmer (2020 leadership contest)**  \n(Constituencies they represented at the 2019\u202fUK General Election)\n\n| MP | Constituency (2019) |\n|---|---|\n| **Rushanara\u202fAli** | Bethnal Green and\u202fBow |\n| **Margaret\u202fBeckett** | Derby South |\n| **Clive\u202fEfford** | Eltham |\n| **Rupa\u202fHuq** | Ealing Central and Acton |\n| **David\u202fLammy** | Tottenham |\n| **Tulip\u202fSiddiq** | Hampstead and\u202fKilburn |\n\nThese six MPs were each among the 35 nominating MPs for Jeremy\u202fCorbyn in 2015, and later were among the 82\u202fMP nominators for Keir\u202fStarmer in 2020."